@startuml
|Guest|
start
:Open public booking page;
:Choose specialty, doctor, service;
:Choose date and available slot;
:Enter full name, DOB or birth year, phone;
|System|
:Validate required fields;
if (Identity fields valid?) then (yes)
 :Search Patient candidates;
 if (Strong verified match?) then (yes)
  :Evaluate verified Patient candidate;
 else (no / uncertain)
  :Create Patient or flag possible duplicate;
  note right: Name + DOB/year alone must not auto-merge.
 endif
 :Recheck schedule and slot in transaction;
 if (Slot available?) then (yes)
  :Create Appointment and snapshots;
  :Generate unique BookingCode;
  :Commit transaction;
  |Guest|
  :Show booking confirmation;
  stop
 else (no)
  :Return conflict 409;
  |Guest|
  :Choose another slot;
  stop
 endif
else (no)
 :Return validation errors;
 |Guest|
 :Correct patient information;
 stop
endif
@enduml
